(7280585, 1133660, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Makes me smile.  Lovely memory to keep and share.</td>', 'Sweet!  Makes me smile.  Lovely memory to keep and share.', '2014-11-05 20:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280588, 1134706, 30982, '<td valign="top">Seems almost surreal!  Very nice depth to the shot.</td>', 'Seems almost surreal!  Very nice depth to the shot.', '2014-11-05 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280678, 1133757, 57447, '<td valign="top">Wow!!</td>', 'Wow!!', '2014-11-05 21:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280735, 1134424, 30861, '<td valign="top">Would those be the Spurgeon gals? Jejeje...</td>', 'Would those be the Spurgeon gals? Jejeje...', '2014-11-05 23:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280738, 1133736, 124815, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to figure out if you meant "hawks" until I came upon this "thing" that I truly don''t like (Harry Potter - and please do not chasten me for the lack of appreciation of HP)<br/>The fact is that I love your photograph. All this flapping, the almost audible cries, the sound of the breaking of waves and all this processed with much restraint is mesmerizing<br/>I forgot to mark it. Done</td>', 'Took me a while to figure out if you meant "hawks" until I came upon this "thing" that I truly don''t like (Harry Potter - and please do not chasten me for the lack of appreciation of HP)The fact is that I love your photograph. All this flapping, the almost audible cries, the sound of the breaking of waves and all this processed with much restraint is mesmerizingI forgot to mark it. Done', '2014-11-05 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280739, 1134721, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s not only that I like so much this picture but I learned of this Park for the first time. How interesting this straying from the herd....the story it tells...</td>', 'It''s not only that I like so much this picture but I learned of this Park for the first time. How interesting this straying from the herd....the story it tells...', '2014-11-05 23:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280741, 1133442, 124815, '<td valign="top">So much like Saint-Exupery''s Little Prince!<br/>A lovable shot done beautifully</td>', 'So much like Saint-Exupery''s Little Prince!A lovable shot done beautifully', '2014-11-05 23:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280742, 1134662, 124815, '<td valign="top">Our pet whisperer strikes again! The colors are so well chosen and the feel of a snap shot because of the "intruder" is adorable!</td>', 'Our pet whisperer strikes again! The colors are so well chosen and the feel of a snap shot because of the "intruder" is adorable!', '2014-11-05 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280743, 1133813, 124815, '<td valign="top">I would personally avoid the word "painting" in the title. But that''s not my main point. <br/>I am not usually moved by the elongated tree photographs but this one is different. It has depth and it remains essentially a photograph. <br/>It has the magic of the moment when lost among trees one squints and the path is just "over there" and still so far away and it''s almost like a near death experience....<br/>A very moving image</td>', 'I would personally avoid the word "painting" in the title. But that''s not my main point. I am not usually moved by the elongated tree photographs but this one is different. It has depth and it remains essentially a photograph. It has the magic of the moment when lost among trees one squints and the path is just "over there" and still so far away and it''s almost like a near death experience....A very moving image', '2014-11-05 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280744, 1134321, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is almost an Ellis Island photo. How I wish you would have cropped the top white neon lights!<br/>I look at your picture and push it up to crop the lights and just love it and that''s how I''ll mark it.</td>', 'This is almost an Ellis Island photo. How I wish you would have cropped the top white neon lights!I look at your picture and push it up to crop the lights and just love it and that''s how I''ll mark it.', '2014-11-05 23:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280745, 1133369, 124815, '<td valign="top">A natural formation so similar to cathedrals'' flying buttresses! What temperature and for how long to achieve this?</td>', 'A natural formation so similar to cathedrals'' flying buttresses! What temperature and for how long to achieve this?', '2014-11-05 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280746, 1134608, 124815, '<td valign="top">it''s more like team work! Little gem</td>', 'it''s more like team work! Little gem', '2014-11-05 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280754, 1133645, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen.  An intriguing trio, to be sure!</td>', 'Well seen.  An intriguing trio, to be sure!', '2014-11-06 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280755, 1133442, 30982, '<td valign="top">He does look a little pensive.  Or perhaps it''s just getting clsoe to naptime.</td>', 'He does look a little pensive.  Or perhaps it''s just getting clsoe to naptime.', '2014-11-06 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280757, 1134653, 30982, '<td valign="top">A charming little place!  Wouldn''t want to walk too close to the edge, though!  Colors may be a bit on the enhanced side, but I think it adds a certain postcard-type charm.</td>', 'A charming little place!  Wouldn''t want to walk too close to the edge, though!  Colors may be a bit on the enhanced side, but I think it adds a certain postcard-type charm.', '2014-11-06 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280758, 1134407, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice golden glow of the light.  I think I see a man, and some sort of flock?  Or am I just making that up?</td>', 'Nice golden glow of the light.  I think I see a man, and some sort of flock?  Or am I just making that up?', '2014-11-06 01:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280759, 1134097, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  This is quite delightful!!</td>', 'Ha!  This is quite delightful!!', '2014-11-06 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280760, 1134595, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on shots like this.  I like street photography, and I think there''s a need for documenting life, but I also am not sold on taking advantage of someone.  Were you to show this to her, would she approve?  Or does that matter in the end?  I think I worry about this more than I used to as I get older myself, and realize I could be a target for shots like this sooner than I realize.</td>', 'I''m torn on shots like this.  I like street photography, and I think there''s a need for documenting life, but I also am not sold on taking advantage of someone.  Were you to show this to her, would she approve?  Or does that matter in the end?  I think I worry about this more than I used to as I get older myself, and realize I could be a target for shots like this sooner than I realize.', '2014-11-06 01:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280761, 1134567, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not an angle I''ve seen before - great work with the light!!</td>', 'Not an angle I''ve seen before - great work with the light!!', '2014-11-06 01:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280762, 1133275, 30982, '<td valign="top">How did you get a bird into a studio?  :-)  Very clean and crisp - nice detail!</td>', 'How did you get a bird into a studio?  :-)  Very clean and crisp - nice detail!', '2014-11-06 01:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280763, 1133363, 30982, '<td valign="top">A whole world in her eye!</td>', 'A whole world in her eye!', '2014-11-06 01:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280764, 1134839, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the inclusion of the wing.  I thought I was the only one who did that.  Nice view of the city!</td>', 'I love the inclusion of the wing.  I thought I was the only one who did that.  Nice view of the city!', '2014-11-06 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280765, 1134931, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bathed in clouds.  Crisp and clean and not overdone; excellent example of how to shoot a landscape.</td>', 'Bathed in clouds.  Crisp and clean and not overdone; excellent example of how to shoot a landscape.', '2014-11-06 01:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280766, 1133528, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the echo of the second bird.</td>', 'I like the echo of the second bird.', '2014-11-06 01:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280767, 1134661, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kingdom for a proper title!  Sorry - it''s my pet peeve this week.  I''ve voted every challenge and I''ve seen quite a few who''ve left their editing title as the placeholder.  It''s so much kinder to your entry - and this is a warm, vibrant entry worthy of the care - to have a title.  Looks like a lovely, peaceful retreat.</td>', 'My kingdom for a proper title!  Sorry - it''s my pet peeve this week.  I''ve voted every challenge and I''ve seen quite a few who''ve left their editing title as the placeholder.  It''s so much kinder to your entry - and this is a warm, vibrant entry worthy of the care - to have a title.  Looks like a lovely, peaceful retreat.', '2014-11-06 01:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280768, 1134851, 30982, '<td valign="top">Impossibly serene.</td>', 'Impossibly serene.', '2014-11-06 01:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280770, 1134439, 30982, '<td valign="top">Urban but isolated.  Interesting take on the urban theme, though.  Amidst all our building and structure, we still seek out solitude.</td>', 'Urban but isolated.  Interesting take on the urban theme, though.  Amidst all our building and structure, we still seek out solitude.', '2014-11-06 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280771, 1133598, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit overcooked on the sky but a nice view and suprisingly people-free, excelt for the lady or gent in the red coat across the way.</td>', 'A bit overcooked on the sky but a nice view and suprisingly people-free, excelt for the lady or gent in the red coat across the way.', '2014-11-06 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280772, 1134453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a little oversharpened for my taste, but a nice take on this iconic view.  You had a very cooperative sky.</td>', 'Perhaps just a little oversharpened for my taste, but a nice take on this iconic view.  You had a very cooperative sky.', '2014-11-06 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280773, 1133989, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love simple, gorgeous shots like this.  There''s so much to enjoy.... the light on the rails, the sweep of the linees, and the reach of those creeping rays of sunlight.  Well seen, nicely presented.</td>', 'I love simple, gorgeous shots like this.  There''s so much to enjoy.... the light on the rails, the sweep of the linees, and the reach of those creeping rays of sunlight.  Well seen, nicely presented.', '2014-11-06 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280774, 1134614, 30982, '<td valign="top">What intensity!!  A wonderful capture - thanks for sharing.!</td>', 'What intensity!!  A wonderful capture - thanks for sharing.!', '2014-11-06 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280775, 1134740, 30982, '<td valign="top">Must be early Sunday morning, yes?  Some lovely old places.</td>', 'Must be early Sunday morning, yes?  Some lovely old places.', '2014-11-06 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280777, 1134766, 30982, '<td valign="top">I swear, when this opened on my computer the figure in the front was not there then suddenly appeared.  I have no idea how you did that.  (And I do realize it didn''t actually do that, it just appeared that way.)  I must also add, however, my pet-peeve "please put in an actual title of some kind" mini-sorta-rant.  It does your work a disservice to leave the image number as the title, unless of course your actual title is IMG_3510, but I suspect not.</td>', 'I swear, when this opened on my computer the figure in the front was not there then suddenly appeared.  I have no idea how you did that.  (And I do realize it didn''t actually do that, it just appeared that way.)  I must also add, however, my pet-peeve "please put in an actual title of some kind" mini-sorta-rant.  It does your work a disservice to leave the image number as the title, unless of course your actual title is IMG_3510, but I suspect not.', '2014-11-06 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280778, 1133962, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very striking!  The trees are a bit oversharpened as I view it, but the constrast throughout is very good!</td>', 'Wow!  Very striking!  The trees are a bit oversharpened as I view it, but the constrast throughout is very good!', '2014-11-06 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280779, 1134434, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely place that must have been in person.  Thanks for sharing the view!</td>', 'What a lovely place that must have been in person.  Thanks for sharing the view!', '2014-11-06 01:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280783, 1133385, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awww, she''s showing off for you!  Lovely catch - roseate spoonbill?  Interesting to see one presented in B&amp;W!</td>', 'Awww, she''s showing off for you!  Lovely catch - roseate spoonbill?  Interesting to see one presented in B&W!', '2014-11-06 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
