(7280793, 1134851, 114285, '<td valign="top">Is that a little sguiggly signature to the left, I hope not for your sake :)<br/> <br/>Now about the photo - dreamy comes to mind, something quite out of this world, maybe it was!</td>', 'Is that a little sguiggly signature to the left, I hope not for your sake :) Now about the photo - dreamy comes to mind, something quite out of this world, maybe it was!', '2014-11-06 02:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
