(7280827, 1134825, 81362, '<td valign="top">In theater, curtains at the sides and fabric across the top of the stage provide a setting for the action. Here, the green vegetation on the sides and top accomplish the same. On the bottom, the fine textured dirt and gravel mixed with clumps of grass seems unnecessary and distracting. Cropping it away could allow viewers easier appreciation of the detailed reflection of the building.</td>', 'In theater, curtains at the sides and fabric across the top of the stage provide a setting for the action. Here, the green vegetation on the sides and top accomplish the same. On the bottom, the fine textured dirt and gravel mixed with clumps of grass seems unnecessary and distracting. Cropping it away could allow viewers easier appreciation of the detailed reflection of the building.', '2014-11-06 05:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280829, 1133469, 81362, '<td valign="top">Lots of life captured in this image. Black and white works very well to allow appreciation of the interesting patterns of light and less light everywhere in the floor. Bumping up a point on second look.</td>', 'Lots of life captured in this image. Black and white works very well to allow appreciation of the interesting patterns of light and less light everywhere in the floor. Bumping up a point on second look.', '2014-11-06 05:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280833, 1134820, 159723, '<td valign="top">Clever :) Perfect image for b&amp;w</td>', 'Clever :) Perfect image for b&w', '2014-11-06 05:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280836, 1134567, 159723, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a couple of images from this place and they never stop to amaze me! I''m not a hundred percent sure, but I think I would have liked a bit more details in the foreground, but still...soooo beautiful!</td>', 'I''ve seen a couple of images from this place and they never stop to amaze me! I''m not a hundred percent sure, but I think I would have liked a bit more details in the foreground, but still...soooo beautiful!', '2014-11-06 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280839, 1134941, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good eye to capture the abstract potential in a potentially mundane scene. Upright black post crosses thin horizontal line (would echo a religious cross if the tiny horizontal black bit were cropped off the left, but leaving that anchors this as a partly environmental abstract showing harbor exit), white vertical elements contrast with light grey sky, texture of shade/screen material interacts with texture of water surface. Not eye candy, so at risk of ending with lower score than justified by artistic merit.</td>', 'Good eye to capture the abstract potential in a potentially mundane scene. Upright black post crosses thin horizontal line (would echo a religious cross if the tiny horizontal black bit were cropped off the left, but leaving that anchors this as a partly environmental abstract showing harbor exit), white vertical elements contrast with light grey sky, texture of shade/screen material interacts with texture of water surface. Not eye candy, so at risk of ending with lower score than justified by artistic merit.', '2014-11-06 06:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280841, 1134422, 81362, '<td valign="top">Enjoying the paintbrush stroke effect of the blurred background.</td>', 'Enjoying the paintbrush stroke effect of the blurred background.', '2014-11-06 06:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280844, 1134564, 81362, '<td valign="top">Title says it all. Getting sharp detail and excellent framing is harder than casual observers can imagine. Having the person''s face identifiable elevates this into a combination of action shot and environmental portrait.</td>', 'Title says it all. Getting sharp detail and excellent framing is harder than casual observers can imagine. Having the person''s face identifiable elevates this into a combination of action shot and environmental portrait.', '2014-11-06 06:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280845, 1133736, 159723, '<td valign="top">I love the what you have done to this image, and it is a lovely composition. I''m still learning, but I''m guessing you had a really fast shutter speed (or using a tripod), as the birds and the sea is so crisp. I think I would have given this a 10 instead of a 9 if the birds were not quite as sharp. I think it might have suited the vintage look more. Or maybe I''m completely wrong :)</td>', 'I love the what you have done to this image, and it is a lovely composition. I''m still learning, but I''m guessing you had a really fast shutter speed (or using a tripod), as the birds and the sea is so crisp. I think I would have given this a 10 instead of a 9 if the birds were not quite as sharp. I think it might have suited the vintage look more. Or maybe I''m completely wrong :)', '2014-11-06 06:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280848, 1134930, 81362, '<td valign="top">The face shape and hand gesture suggest Japanese influence. Positioning less centrally might impart a better sense of that off-balance feeling when confronted with the unexpected. Overlap of submission dates makes me wonder if you intended to enter the Halloween challenge.</td>', 'The face shape and hand gesture suggest Japanese influence. Positioning less centrally might impart a better sense of that off-balance feeling when confronted with the unexpected. Overlap of submission dates makes me wonder if you intended to enter the Halloween challenge.', '2014-11-06 06:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
