(7281116, 1134826, 101668, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to comment on as many as I can, so please bear with me. The image lacks wow factor, the thirds rule could''ve done much to make it more pleasing as well as a little contrast. Skyline isn''t straight</td>', 'I''m trying to comment on as many as I can, so please bear with me. The image lacks wow factor, the thirds rule could''ve done much to make it more pleasing as well as a little contrast. Skyline isn''t straight', '2014-11-06 16:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
