(7281140, 1133373, 101668, '<td valign="top">Red catches the eye. Lovely</td>', 'Red catches the eye. Lovely', '2014-11-06 16:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281141, 1133388, 101668, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go there. Lovely, real great photography and pp</td>', 'Makes me want to go there. Lovely, real great photography and pp', '2014-11-06 16:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281143, 1134839, 101668, '<td valign="top">Well done, great shot</td>', 'Well done, great shot', '2014-11-06 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281144, 1133363, 101668, '<td valign="top">Focussed</td>', 'Focussed', '2014-11-06 16:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281146, 1133410, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great eye, great shot a little centred but good job nonetheless</td>', 'Great eye, great shot a little centred but good job nonetheless', '2014-11-06 17:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281168, 1134621, 47974, '<td valign="top">Image would have been a lot better if you had brightened the area around the eye.  That way you have something to draw the person into your photograph.</td>', 'Image would have been a lot better if you had brightened the area around the eye.  That way you have something to draw the person into your photograph.', '2014-11-06 17:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281169, 1134669, 47974, '<td valign="top">She has such beautiful blue eyes, to bad they are not in focus.</td>', 'She has such beautiful blue eyes, to bad they are not in focus.', '2014-11-06 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281170, 1134645, 47974, '<td valign="top">The landscape is beautiful but the overall image is just dull.  There is nothing to get the view excited about or to draw there eye into it.</td>', 'The landscape is beautiful but the overall image is just dull.  There is nothing to get the view excited about or to draw there eye into it.', '2014-11-06 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281171, 1133177, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really want to give some sort of helpful comment but there is just nothing I can say about this image.</td>', 'I really want to give some sort of helpful comment but there is just nothing I can say about this image.', '2014-11-06 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281172, 1133989, 47974, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit dark and there is nothing to draw the eye into the photograph, not real sure what the subject is for the photograph.</td>', 'The image is a bit dark and there is nothing to draw the eye into the photograph, not real sure what the subject is for the photograph.', '2014-11-06 17:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281175, 1134872, 37858, '<td valign="top">O.K.  ...So midway through all the beautiful and near-beautiful images in this challenge, I come to this one.  Say what?  <br/> <br/>But I can''t let it go.  It has a pull on me that sends me to the internet to see what the title mean.  I''m told it means "unhurt, unstruck" and is often used in the context of music as a calm, maybe even a pure, tone.  <br/> <br/>So now I am back, armed with this information....  Only it looks like it might be the opposite of "unhurt, unstruck" -- musically or otherwise.<br/> <br/>Still can''t let it go...even though (and maybe because) it''s an enigma to me.  I like the abstraction, the vague human form, the coil/trunk/snake-like thingy.  ...and it looks very "hurt" and "struck" so much that the upper part is obliterated...assuming there was an upper part.<br/> <br/>O.K.  This much intrigue and thought-provoking impact deserves recognition.  9.  (If I could figure it out, it would be a 10.  My failing, perhaps, but the artist''s task too.)  So... 9 it is.<br/> <br/>Btw, "thingy" in my lexicon is art-speak for "I don''t have a clue."</td>', 'O.K.  ...So midway through all the beautiful and near-beautiful images in this challenge, I come to this one.  Say what?   But I can''t let it go.  It has a pull on me that sends me to the internet to see what the title mean.  I''m told it means "unhurt, unstruck" and is often used in the context of music as a calm, maybe even a pure, tone.   So now I am back, armed with this information....  Only it looks like it might be the opposite of "unhurt, unstruck" -- musically or otherwise. Still can''t let it go...even though (and maybe because) it''s an enigma to me.  I like the abstraction, the vague human form, the coil/trunk/snake-like thingy.  ...and it looks very "hurt" and "struck" so much that the upper part is obliterated...assuming there was an upper part. O.K.  This much intrigue and thought-provoking impact deserves recognition.  9.  (If I could figure it out, it would be a 10.  My failing, perhaps, but the artist''s task too.)  So... 9 it is. Btw, "thingy" in my lexicon is art-speak for "I don''t have a clue."', '2014-11-06 17:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281176, 1134678, 47974, '<td valign="top">Overall the image is a bit flat and I am not sure what you are wanting the view to concentrate on.  The arc (which the name suggest is the subject) is a little to far left to be the subject.  The hole to the right is what actually attracts my attention but is not interesting enough to hold it.  I think if you had moved right and shot over the hole while looking thru the arch it would be a much stronger photograph.</td>', 'Overall the image is a bit flat and I am not sure what you are wanting the view to concentrate on.  The arc (which the name suggest is the subject) is a little to far left to be the subject.  The hole to the right is what actually attracts my attention but is not interesting enough to hold it.  I think if you had moved right and shot over the hole while looking thru the arch it would be a much stronger photograph.', '2014-11-06 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281177, 1134808, 47974, '<td valign="top">The golden color of the reeds is really beautiful.  Would have preferred them being the subject than the sky.  It also looks as tho you pushed the image to far in processing and made the top part of the sky (the blue) look over processed.</td>', 'The golden color of the reeds is really beautiful.  Would have preferred them being the subject than the sky.  It also looks as tho you pushed the image to far in processing and made the top part of the sky (the blue) look over processed.', '2014-11-06 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281178, 1134097, 37858, '<td valign="top">Had to laugh here.</td>', 'Had to laugh here.', '2014-11-06 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281179, 1134893, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well executed photograph.  I just find the clothing differences odd and distract from the image.  I can not come up with a reason in mind as to why the girl is wearing proper shoes and a beautiful dress and the guy has no shoes and seems to be wearing spandex underwear and a tank top.</td>', 'Beautiful and well executed photograph.  I just find the clothing differences odd and distract from the image.  I can not come up with a reason in mind as to why the girl is wearing proper shoes and a beautiful dress and the guy has no shoes and seems to be wearing spandex underwear and a tank top.', '2014-11-06 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281180, 1134653, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place...........I like how the post lead the eye into the photograph.  To bad the sky does not match the rest of the photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful place...........I like how the post lead the eye into the photograph.  To bad the sky does not match the rest of the photograph.', '2014-11-06 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281181, 1133750, 37858, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this a little larger.  Nice silhouettes.</td>', 'I would like to have seen this a little larger.  Nice silhouettes.', '2014-11-06 18:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281182, 1134697, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and dramatic sky.  I find the foreground being in such sharp focus distracting.  Would have been better to leave them out and use the outcrop on the right to give the sense of scale to the photograph.  The highlights in the sky also seem to be blown with no detail.</td>', 'Wonderful and dramatic sky.  I find the foreground being in such sharp focus distracting.  Would have been better to leave them out and use the outcrop on the right to give the sense of scale to the photograph.  The highlights in the sky also seem to be blown with no detail.', '2014-11-06 18:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281183, 1134931, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well executed.  Love how the clouds and right side slope frame the mountain peek in the background.  Personally I would have cropped out the dark sky in the top left, feel it distracts from the scene.</td>', 'Beautiful and well executed.  Love how the clouds and right side slope frame the mountain peek in the background.  Personally I would have cropped out the dark sky in the top left, feel it distracts from the scene.', '2014-11-06 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281184, 1134766, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really love this photograph.  Very artistic and well executed. Love the added grain and while dark you can make out the person and their face really pops from the image.  I only have one nit picky thing and that is the blob on the left along the top of the white / bottom of black line over in the sky, I would have used the healing brush to make it go away (is just a little distracting).  One other problem (but it is not your fault) is with the bigger size vertical photographs have a serious problem as I (not sure about others) can not see the entire image without scrolling.</td>', 'I really love this photograph.  Very artistic and well executed. Love the added grain and while dark you can make out the person and their face really pops from the image.  I only have one nit picky thing and that is the blob on the left along the top of the white / bottom of black line over in the sky, I would have used the healing brush to make it go away (is just a little distracting).  One other problem (but it is not your fault) is with the bigger size vertical photographs have a serious problem as I (not sure about others) can not see the entire image without scrolling.', '2014-11-06 18:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281185, 1134487, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well executed photograph.  Love how the rainbow seems to come from the peak.  The colors are wonderful without being over saturated.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful and well executed photograph.  Love how the rainbow seems to come from the peak.  The colors are wonderful without being over saturated.  Great job.', '2014-11-06 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281186, 1134032, 47974, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful capture of a wonderful subject.  DOF is perfect, not to much/not to little.  The color is spot on and I love the reflection in the eye.  Great image.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful capture of a wonderful subject.  DOF is perfect, not to much/not to little.  The color is spot on and I love the reflection in the eye.  Great image.', '2014-11-06 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281187, 1133296, 47974, '<td valign="top">While I love and do rate artistic photographs highly, this one just does nothing for me.</td>', 'While I love and do rate artistic photographs highly, this one just does nothing for me.', '2014-11-06 18:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281203, 1134109, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and perfect composition, just wish it was a little brighter.</td>', 'Love the subject and perfect composition, just wish it was a little brighter.', '2014-11-06 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281204, 1134528, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and engaging photograph.  I really like it.</td>', 'Very interesting and engaging photograph.  I really like it.', '2014-11-06 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281206, 1133165, 47974, '<td valign="top">I like high contrast B&amp;W but in this case the head came out way to dark.  You really needed the eye to be brighter to draw in the viewer.  The horizon gives the impression of being slanted, even tho the bison looks level.  Either way it is a bit distracting.  Would have also preferred if you had submitted it at the new higher size, after a bunch of bigger images it is hard looking at the smaller image.</td>', 'I like high contrast B&W but in this case the head came out way to dark.  You really needed the eye to be brighter to draw in the viewer.  The horizon gives the impression of being slanted, even tho the bison looks level.  Either way it is a bit distracting.  Would have also preferred if you had submitted it at the new higher size, after a bunch of bigger images it is hard looking at the smaller image.', '2014-11-06 19:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281207, 1133362, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very interesting long exposure photograph, almost gives the impression that they are underwater in the tea cups.</td>', 'Very interesting long exposure photograph, almost gives the impression that they are underwater in the tea cups.', '2014-11-06 19:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281209, 1133816, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very nice natural light portrait.  I really like the mystery created by the left eye just being visible in the shadowed side of her face.  One problem that is not your fault is the new sizes require me to scroll to view the entire photo when they are in portrait.  Really hurts those photos in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice natural light portrait.  I really like the mystery created by the left eye just being visible in the shadowed side of her face.  One problem that is not your fault is the new sizes require me to scroll to view the entire photo when they are in portrait.  Really hurts those photos in my opinion.', '2014-11-06 19:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281210, 1134544, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and amazing photograph.  Really love the colors and tones and you included just the right amount of sky.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful and amazing photograph.  Really love the colors and tones and you included just the right amount of sky.  Great job.', '2014-11-06 19:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281211, 1133560, 47974, '<td valign="top">The photograph is soft and/or out of focus.  For future wildlife photos try to photograph from a lower angle, do not be afraid to get down on the animals level.  Also, make sure the eyes are bright and visible (many ways in post you can accomplish this) to draw the viewer into the photo.</td>', 'The photograph is soft and/or out of focus.  For future wildlife photos try to photograph from a lower angle, do not be afraid to get down on the animals level.  Also, make sure the eyes are bright and visible (many ways in post you can accomplish this) to draw the viewer into the photo.', '2014-11-06 19:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281234, 1134702, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done, beautiful location!</td>', 'Well done, beautiful location!', '2014-11-06 21:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281236, 1134888, 57447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light.</td>', 'Beautiful light.', '2014-11-06 21:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281261, 1134820, 50864, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic capture and beautifully photographed. 10</td>', 'What a fantastic capture and beautifully photographed. 10', '2014-11-06 22:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281268, 1134321, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this. The wonderful colors and grain, the multiple exposers and interesting  subject(s) all together in one fascinating image. 10</td>', 'I like everything about this. The wonderful colors and grain, the multiple exposers and interesting  subject(s) all together in one fascinating image. 10', '2014-11-06 23:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281269, 1133520, 47974, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet and precious photograph.  Perfect use of DOF and focus to draw the eye right to the kitties face.</td>', 'Such a sweet and precious photograph.  Perfect use of DOF and focus to draw the eye right to the kitties face.', '2014-11-06 23:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281270, 1134941, 50864, '<td valign="top">I love this. Love the textured drape. Love the black and white break down the middle. Love the tones and how they make up the image. Most of all I love the little hanging chain. 10</td>', 'I love this. Love the textured drape. Love the black and white break down the middle. Love the tones and how they make up the image. Most of all I love the little hanging chain. 10', '2014-11-06 23:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281271, 1133250, 38162, '<td valign="top">clunky border to me actually makes this claustrophobic; such a terrific conceptual image.  gl</td>', 'clunky border to me actually makes this claustrophobic; such a terrific conceptual image.  gl', '2014-11-06 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281272, 1134112, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful and peaceful capture. The lack of detail in the neck is distracting.  I would suspect that most would not notice it, but being a wildlife photographer and this my favorite bird I can''t help but wonder why when I look at it.</td>', 'Really beautiful and peaceful capture. The lack of detail in the neck is distracting.  I would suspect that most would not notice it, but being a wildlife photographer and this my favorite bird I can''t help but wonder why when I look at it.', '2014-11-06 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281273, 1133566, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait but a little dark, especially the eyes.</td>', 'Nice portrait but a little dark, especially the eyes.', '2014-11-06 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281274, 1134766, 50864, '<td valign="top">There are some really amazing pictures in this challenge and this is one of them. The centered massive structure in front of the centered small figure is brilliant. Tones and grain seem perfect. 10</td>', 'There are some really amazing pictures in this challenge and this is one of them. The centered massive structure in front of the centered small figure is brilliant. Tones and grain seem perfect. 10', '2014-11-06 23:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281276, 1133806, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great shot but not a fan of this style.  Either B&amp;W or color but a mixture is just something I am not a fan of.  I see you are trying to point out the line of taxi''s but in  your attempt you make it obvious that the right hand one is cut off and you can''t see the entire car.  This technique would have been more effective if you had not cut off the front of that taxi.</td>', 'Great shot but not a fan of this style.  Either B&W or color but a mixture is just something I am not a fan of.  I see you are trying to point out the line of taxi''s but in  your attempt you make it obvious that the right hand one is cut off and you can''t see the entire car.  This technique would have been more effective if you had not cut off the front of that taxi.', '2014-11-06 23:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281277, 1134821, 47974, '<td valign="top">Dull and uninspiring photograph.  The bird is also looking to the right but you have the photo cropped right up by his beak, giving him nothing to look at per say.</td>', 'Dull and uninspiring photograph.  The bird is also looking to the right but you have the photo cropped right up by his beak, giving him nothing to look at per say.', '2014-11-06 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281281, 1133332, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great timing and control of the flash reflecting off the water.</td>', 'Great timing and control of the flash reflecting off the water.', '2014-11-06 23:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281283, 1134913, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones in the image but the lack anything to draw my eye into it leaves me trying to find something to focus on.</td>', 'Really like the tones in the image but the lack anything to draw my eye into it leaves me trying to find something to focus on.', '2014-11-06 23:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281284, 1133558, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and perspective.  Like how the bridges help lead the eye into the photograph.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and perspective.  Like how the bridges help lead the eye into the photograph.', '2014-11-06 23:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281285, 1133202, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image that shows the story of the location.  Really like that you used a lower perspective then what most would have, gives the image more impact.</td>', 'Wonderful image that shows the story of the location.  Really like that you used a lower perspective then what most would have, gives the image more impact.', '2014-11-06 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281286, 1133823, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful control of the dark horse(?) against the snow.  Love how the snow surrounds the eye and helps draw the eye towards his eye.  Very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful control of the dark horse(?) against the snow.  Love how the snow surrounds the eye and helps draw the eye towards his eye.  Very well done.', '2014-11-06 23:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281288, 1134861, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great subject and processing.  Unfortunately you have the same problem all the other vertical shots do, I have to scroll to see the entire thing.</td>', 'Great subject and processing.  Unfortunately you have the same problem all the other vertical shots do, I have to scroll to see the entire thing.', '2014-11-06 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281296, 1134413, 47974, '<td valign="top">Photos is to soft and the colors are a bit dull.  Nice composition, would just like to see a bit more pop and for the central flower to be in focus.</td>', 'Photos is to soft and the colors are a bit dull.  Nice composition, would just like to see a bit more pop and for the central flower to be in focus.', '2014-11-06 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281297, 1134211, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape photograph.  Love the lighting around the fort (?), really makes the image pop without being over powering.</td>', 'Wonderful landscape photograph.  Love the lighting around the fort (?), really makes the image pop without being over powering.', '2014-11-06 23:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281298, 1133180, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture and perspective.  Love the railing that leads your eye into the photograph and the tall buildings in the back.  The overcast sky with the buildings lights reflecting off it really adds drama and interest to the photograph.  One distraction is that light under the railing to the left.</td>', 'Great capture and perspective.  Love the railing that leads your eye into the photograph and the tall buildings in the back.  The overcast sky with the buildings lights reflecting off it really adds drama and interest to the photograph.  One distraction is that light under the railing to the left.', '2014-11-06 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281299, 1134596, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great smoke capture and love the colors.  My mind wants to say red, white, blue but my eye sees blue, white, red.......feel it would have been much stronger with the blue and red reversed.</td>', 'Great smoke capture and love the colors.  My mind wants to say red, white, blue but my eye sees blue, white, red.......feel it would have been much stronger with the blue and red reversed.', '2014-11-06 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281300, 1133471, 47974, '<td valign="top">OMG, the over saturation makes my eyes bleed.  This looks as tho it could have been a wonderful landscape if you had not pushed the saturation to such extremes.</td>', 'OMG, the over saturation makes my eyes bleed.  This looks as tho it could have been a wonderful landscape if you had not pushed the saturation to such extremes.', '2014-11-06 23:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281301, 1133795, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great macro and detail.  Only complaint is the black background that comes from using to much flash in macro photography, gives an artificial appearance in my opinion.  One other thing is be aware that vertical shots require scrolling to see the entire image.</td>', 'Great macro and detail.  Only complaint is the black background that comes from using to much flash in macro photography, gives an artificial appearance in my opinion.  One other thing is be aware that vertical shots require scrolling to see the entire image.', '2014-11-06 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281302, 1133388, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and perfect with just the right amount of sky, which is dramatic and really adds to the photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful and perfect with just the right amount of sky, which is dramatic and really adds to the photograph.', '2014-11-06 23:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281304, 1134619, 47974, '<td valign="top">Dull and uninspiring.  The horizon is at center line which makes for uninteresting, either feature the sky or land to add more impact and interest.  The highlights in the sky are also blown out.</td>', 'Dull and uninspiring.  The horizon is at center line which makes for uninteresting, either feature the sky or land to add more impact and interest.  The highlights in the sky are also blown out.', '2014-11-06 23:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
