(7281355, 1134720, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lifestyles of the beautiful.  I just now realised the girl next to her is, well, her.  I''m kinda slow sometimes.  You could crop a bit of her reflection, but you''d have to be willing to lose part or all of the reflected hand.  I like the soft focus/glow treatment.  Adds to the warmth of the photograph.</td>', 'Lifestyles of the beautiful.  I just now realised the girl next to her is, well, her.  I''m kinda slow sometimes.  You could crop a bit of her reflection, but you''d have to be willing to lose part or all of the reflected hand.  I like the soft focus/glow treatment.  Adds to the warmth of the photograph.', '2014-11-07 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
