(7281445, 1133322, 81362, '<td valign="top">Really interesting swirls of light on the hills (that do indeed look like sand dunes in the Sahara) make a striking composition. At quick glance from a distance the image could have a similar light pattern from a sky at sunset. Slight rotation clockwise a tic or two to make the lines of the grain elevator more upright would help.</td>', 'Really interesting swirls of light on the hills (that do indeed look like sand dunes in the Sahara) make a striking composition. At quick glance from a distance the image could have a similar light pattern from a sky at sunset. Slight rotation clockwise a tic or two to make the lines of the grain elevator more upright would help.', '2014-11-07 06:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281446, 1134649, 81362, '<td valign="top">Somehow the brightness of lighting on the shack transform the quiet sunset landscape into a festive looking setting. Refreshing change from typical sun-goes-down-at-the-beach cliche.</td>', 'Somehow the brightness of lighting on the shack transform the quiet sunset landscape into a festive looking setting. Refreshing change from typical sun-goes-down-at-the-beach cliche.', '2014-11-07 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281447, 1134728, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice overall color. Almost missed the intricate subtle design of thin light lines snaking along energetically.  Wouldn''t it be fun to have drinking straws imprinted to match the design on these two tubes?</td>', 'Nice overall color. Almost missed the intricate subtle design of thin light lines snaking along energetically.  Wouldn''t it be fun to have drinking straws imprinted to match the design on these two tubes?', '2014-11-07 06:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281448, 1134920, 81362, '<td valign="top">What could have been a family outing snapshot gets elevated to the realm of art. Excellent framing, and great to have adequate light on the seated girl.</td>', 'What could have been a family outing snapshot gets elevated to the realm of art. Excellent framing, and great to have adequate light on the seated girl.', '2014-11-07 06:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281449, 1133757, 81362, '<td valign="top">Impressive point of view, with firework bursts captured at just the right moment to balance the composition. Hope your notes let us know how you managed to get this one.</td>', 'Impressive point of view, with firework bursts captured at just the right moment to balance the composition. Hope your notes let us know how you managed to get this one.', '2014-11-07 06:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281450, 1133889, 81362, '<td valign="top">Great timing to capture peak of the bucking motion and the instant of first reactions of the people. Rodeos provide lots of light, allowing stopping the action with shutter speed instead of flash. Looks like you may have been blessed with just enough overcast sky to escape the excessively harsh shadows that often come along with this setting.</td>', 'Great timing to capture peak of the bucking motion and the instant of first reactions of the people. Rodeos provide lots of light, allowing stopping the action with shutter speed instead of flash. Looks like you may have been blessed with just enough overcast sky to escape the excessively harsh shadows that often come along with this setting.', '2014-11-07 06:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281451, 1134438, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very cute expression of the fascinated child. Love the expressions of adults in the background.</td>', 'Very cute expression of the fascinated child. Love the expressions of adults in the background.', '2014-11-07 06:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281452, 1134759, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice compromise between macro detail and garden setting elements. Should do well.</td>', 'Nice compromise between macro detail and garden setting elements. Should do well.', '2014-11-07 06:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281485, 1134843, 109227, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this; the light is beautiful and well captured.</td>', 'I love the colors in this; the light is beautiful and well captured.', '2014-11-07 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281488, 1133940, 109227, '<td valign="top">One of my favs.  The capture of motion and the light are great.</td>', 'One of my favs.  The capture of motion and the light are great.', '2014-11-07 09:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
