(7281514, 1134720, 109227, '<td valign="top">Lovely bridal image.  The softness works well with the light and enough details come through to make it look magical.  I am sure the couple love it.</td>', 'Lovely bridal image.  The softness works well with the light and enough details come through to make it look magical.  I am sure the couple love it.', '2014-11-07 10:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281515, 1133164, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and great job on working with the light so well.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and great job on working with the light so well.', '2014-11-07 10:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281517, 1133199, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this image, and the B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this image, and the B&W works well.', '2014-11-07 10:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281518, 1134097, 109227, '<td valign="top">Ha, brings a smile to my face each time I view this.</td>', 'Ha, brings a smile to my face each time I view this.', '2014-11-07 10:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281519, 1133823, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed and you have captured the look and feel of the cold wind.</td>', 'Wonderfully composed and you have captured the look and feel of the cold wind.', '2014-11-07 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281520, 1134487, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wish I were there.</td>', 'Wish I were there.', '2014-11-07 10:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281521, 1133248, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great candid and just enough color to make it stand out.</td>', 'Great candid and just enough color to make it stand out.', '2014-11-07 10:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281523, 1134697, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great detail and dof.  I like the muted tones.</td>', 'Great detail and dof.  I like the muted tones.', '2014-11-07 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281524, 1133795, 30669, '<td valign="top">Wow. Looks like an alien. Thank God they are small.</td>', 'Wow. Looks like an alien. Thank God they are small.', '2014-11-07 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281532, 1134724, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple and elegant.  Great image and control of DOF. May have looked a bit better with a smooth base opposed to what it is sitting on now.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple and elegant.  Great image and control of DOF. May have looked a bit better with a smooth base opposed to what it is sitting on now.', '2014-11-07 10:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281533, 1134485, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a beautiful scene.  Like the light in the boat, makes you wonder what is going on inside.</td>', 'Great capture of a beautiful scene.  Like the light in the boat, makes you wonder what is going on inside.', '2014-11-07 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281535, 1133733, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of an animal that is hard to photograph because of color and the heavy ridge that tends to put the eyes in shadow.  Really like how you left the bit of green to the right, allowing one to see where the light falling on the head is coming from.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of an animal that is hard to photograph because of color and the heavy ridge that tends to put the eyes in shadow.  Really like how you left the bit of green to the right, allowing one to see where the light falling on the head is coming from.', '2014-11-07 10:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281537, 1133332, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.</td>', 'This is really cool.', '2014-11-07 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281538, 1134438, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and precious scene.  Love the conversion to B&amp;W</td>', 'Wonderful and precious scene.  Love the conversion to B&W', '2014-11-07 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281539, 1133369, 76335, '<td valign="top">How does that happen? Cool.</td>', 'How does that happen? Cool.', '2014-11-07 10:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281540, 1134397, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Calming.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Calming.', '2014-11-07 10:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281541, 1133645, 76335, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to see the bag. But cool.</td>', 'Took me a moment to see the bag. But cool.', '2014-11-07 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281542, 1134761, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2014-11-07 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281544, 1134941, 76335, '<td valign="top">Loving the off-center cross, the layers, the imagination. A ten for you.</td>', 'Loving the off-center cross, the layers, the imagination. A ten for you.', '2014-11-07 10:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281546, 1134722, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting the splashes of white...</td>', 'Interesting the splashes of white...', '2014-11-07 10:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281548, 1133409, 76335, '<td valign="top">Why can''t all animal/nature shots be composed so imaginatively?</td>', 'Why can''t all animal/nature shots be composed so imaginatively?', '2014-11-07 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281550, 1134109, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love the glowing green leaves.</td>', 'Love the glowing green leaves.', '2014-11-07 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281551, 1133739, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2014-11-07 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281555, 1133889, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too much processing. Great moment though.</td>', 'Too much processing. Great moment though.', '2014-11-07 10:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281556, 1134840, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like a lith print. Nice.</td>', 'Like a lith print. Nice.', '2014-11-07 10:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281557, 1134564, 76335, '<td valign="top">You California people...</td>', 'You California people...', '2014-11-07 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281558, 1134829, 76335, '<td valign="top">Presidential!</td>', 'Presidential!', '2014-11-07 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281559, 1134792, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and amazing capture and B&amp;W conversion.  Really love the texture.  Looks like you had a hard time controlling the brightness of the sky against what I assume was a lot darker area where the kitty is.</td>', 'Beautiful and amazing capture and B&W conversion.  Really love the texture.  Looks like you had a hard time controlling the brightness of the sky against what I assume was a lot darker area where the kitty is.', '2014-11-07 10:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281560, 1134046, 76335, '<td valign="top">Would love to see some texture in those clouds. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Would love to see some texture in those clouds. Nicely composed.', '2014-11-07 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7281561, 1134648, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice conversion and great texture.  Unfortunately it looks like the focus was on the lips and not the eyes.</td>', 'Nice conversion and great texture.  Unfortunately it looks like the focus was on the lips and not the eyes.', '2014-11-07 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281562, 1134872, 76335, '<td valign="top">Hellish.</td>', 'Hellish.', '2014-11-07 10:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281563, 1134906, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and perfect alignment of the Milky Way with the lighthouse.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and perfect alignment of the Milky Way with the lighthouse.', '2014-11-07 10:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281565, 1133823, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fantastic -- in the purest sense of the word.</td>', 'Fantastic -- in the purest sense of the word.', '2014-11-07 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281569, 1133442, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very strange post processing.  The shirt seems to be sharp but the skin areas (which includes the eyes) seem to have some serious smoothing applied.  All in all makes for a strange looking photograph.</td>', 'Very strange post processing.  The shirt seems to be sharp but the skin areas (which includes the eyes) seem to have some serious smoothing applied.  All in all makes for a strange looking photograph.', '2014-11-07 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281570, 1134777, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really awesome photograph and such a dramatic sky, makes for a lot of impact.  The red boat draws my eye into the photograph nicely but all the mast make for a busy area that does not seem to let my eye move to sky.</td>', 'Really awesome photograph and such a dramatic sky, makes for a lot of impact.  The red boat draws my eye into the photograph nicely but all the mast make for a busy area that does not seem to let my eye move to sky.', '2014-11-07 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281571, 1134046, 47974, '<td valign="top">This could have been great photograph if you had not over saturated the blues and blown all detail out of the highlights.</td>', 'This could have been great photograph if you had not over saturated the blues and blown all detail out of the highlights.', '2014-11-07 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281573, 1133469, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture and wonderful conversion.  Wish you would have waited to photograph someone with a smile in front of the sign, or even someone with a frown.</td>', 'Great capture and wonderful conversion.  Wish you would have waited to photograph someone with a smile in front of the sign, or even someone with a frown.', '2014-11-07 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281574, 1134839, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture from the plane and conversion.  If you had cropped out that top corner think it would have made the image a bit stronger.</td>', 'Wonderful capture from the plane and conversion.  If you had cropped out that top corner think it would have made the image a bit stronger.', '2014-11-07 10:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281575, 1134694, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph of a beautiful bird.  You accomplished a great balance between keeping detail in the whites and blacks.  Neither are perfect but it''s such a hard thing to accomplish and you did an amazing job.</td>', 'Interesting photograph of a beautiful bird.  You accomplished a great balance between keeping detail in the whites and blacks.  Neither are perfect but it''s such a hard thing to accomplish and you did an amazing job.', '2014-11-07 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281576, 1133757, 47974, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning and amazing, not sure what else I can say.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning and amazing, not sure what else I can say.', '2014-11-07 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281577, 1133598, 47974, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture and perspective.  Normally I have to tell people I wish they had been dead center on something like this, but you are perfectly centered with the arch.  In this case I kind of wish you had gone for centering the building in the very back and been a little off centered on the arch.  The glass in the front catches my eye and leads it up only to be disappointed by the building being cut off.</td>', 'Amazing capture and perspective.  Normally I have to tell people I wish they had been dead center on something like this, but you are perfectly centered with the arch.  In this case I kind of wish you had gone for centering the building in the very back and been a little off centered on the arch.  The glass in the front catches my eye and leads it up only to be disappointed by the building being cut off.', '2014-11-07 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281579, 1134930, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  Love the creativity and control of light/dark.</td>', 'Interesting capture.  Love the creativity and control of light/dark.', '2014-11-07 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281580, 1133294, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and perspective, wish I could see the front of the car tho.</td>', 'Interesting shot and perspective, wish I could see the front of the car tho.', '2014-11-07 11:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281584, 1133943, 118154, '<td valign="top">Looks over sharpened and over done, but I can''t help enjoying it all the same.</td>', 'Looks over sharpened and over done, but I can''t help enjoying it all the same.', '2014-11-07 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281585, 1134451, 118154, '<td valign="top">Looks really false and unreal, I enjoy looking at it emensly .8.</td>', 'Looks really false and unreal, I enjoy looking at it emensly .8.', '2014-11-07 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281587, 1134594, 118154, '<td valign="top">They seem to have tax discs, a fine and thrilling image.</td>', 'They seem to have tax discs, a fine and thrilling image.', '2014-11-07 11:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281588, 1134718, 118154, '<td valign="top">Toppermost than not, lovely stuff.</td>', 'Toppermost than not, lovely stuff.', '2014-11-07 11:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281589, 1134941, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting but visually dull.</td>', 'Interesting but visually dull.', '2014-11-07 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281590, 1134820, 118154, '<td valign="top">All comes together real well in this shot.</td>', 'All comes together real well in this shot.', '2014-11-07 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281592, 1134819, 47974, '<td valign="top">Looks like a snapshot I would take showing my friends how many crabs I caught.  Would have really liked a well composed shot of one crab on the deck of the boat or beach (where ever you were when you caught them) compared to this.</td>', 'Looks like a snapshot I would take showing my friends how many crabs I caught.  Would have really liked a well composed shot of one crab on the deck of the boat or beach (where ever you were when you caught them) compared to this.', '2014-11-07 11:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281594, 1133806, 118154, '<td valign="top">To hackneyed in my view.</td>', 'To hackneyed in my view.', '2014-11-07 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281595, 1134942, 47974, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful capture and a great use of blown out highlights.  Love this photo.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful capture and a great use of blown out highlights.  Love this photo.', '2014-11-07 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281596, 1133153, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting shapes, could have benefited from being a bit brighter and a little more saturated.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting shapes, could have benefited from being a bit brighter and a little more saturated.', '2014-11-07 11:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281597, 1133190, 118154, '<td valign="top">The crop is just too severe in my opinion.</td>', 'The crop is just too severe in my opinion.', '2014-11-07 11:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281599, 1133750, 47974, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful place and sunset/rise.  Would have preferred if you had submitted a larger size (hard to compete with the bigger images).  Could have been stronger by cropping out the bottom part so only the shinny water was visible at the bottom.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful place and sunset/rise.  Would have preferred if you had submitted a larger size (hard to compete with the bigger images).  Could have been stronger by cropping out the bottom part so only the shinny water was visible at the bottom.', '2014-11-07 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281600, 1134925, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little ott for sure but has something memorable in the content.</td>', 'A little ott for sure but has something memorable in the content.', '2014-11-07 11:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281604, 1134720, 47974, '<td valign="top">You forgot to title your photograph.  Nice capture of an intimate movement but appears to have a soft focus technique which personally I am not a fan of.</td>', 'You forgot to title your photograph.  Nice capture of an intimate movement but appears to have a soft focus technique which personally I am not a fan of.', '2014-11-07 11:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281606, 1134595, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great emotional capture and wonderful conversion.  Just wish it was sharper.</td>', 'Great emotional capture and wonderful conversion.  Just wish it was sharper.', '2014-11-07 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281608, 1133185, 118154, '<td valign="top">Sextupets ?</td>', 'Sextupets ?', '2014-11-07 11:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281609, 1134637, 47974, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is going on but looks like this was a serious crop or missed focus because of the lack of detail in the bird and the heavy noise in the sky.  The eye is also very dark, brighten up the eyes of animals/people to draw the viewer in.</td>', 'Not sure what is going on but looks like this was a serious crop or missed focus because of the lack of detail in the bird and the heavy noise in the sky.  The eye is also very dark, brighten up the eyes of animals/people to draw the viewer in.', '2014-11-07 11:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281610, 1134826, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little lacking in drama as the key feature is a bit too far in the distance.</td>', 'A little lacking in drama as the key feature is a bit too far in the distance.', '2014-11-07 11:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281611, 1134761, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and just enough DOF to get all of the mushrooms in.  Think it would have benefited from a tighter crop that left out the black.  A different angle (from lower perspective) may have created a stronger image.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and just enough DOF to get all of the mushrooms in.  Think it would have benefited from a tighter crop that left out the black.  A different angle (from lower perspective) may have created a stronger image.', '2014-11-07 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281612, 1134416, 118154, '<td valign="top">In different conditions I may have looked upon this more fondly.</td>', 'In different conditions I may have looked upon this more fondly.', '2014-11-07 11:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281613, 1133165, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little dull and uninteresting in most ways from here on my throne I sit.</td>', 'A little dull and uninteresting in most ways from here on my throne I sit.', '2014-11-07 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281614, 1134443, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and amazing capture from a great perspective.  Very well done.  Would have loved if you had corrected the curved buildings.</td>', 'Beautiful and amazing capture from a great perspective.  Very well done.  Would have loved if you had corrected the curved buildings.', '2014-11-07 11:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281615, 1134728, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting and beautiful photograph.  Perfect example of what an abstract photograph should look like.</td>', 'Interesting and beautiful photograph.  Perfect example of what an abstract photograph should look like.', '2014-11-07 11:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281616, 1133676, 118154, '<td valign="top">To pull this off with any success I think it needed to have much power and punch which it lacks.</td>', 'To pull this off with any success I think it needed to have much power and punch which it lacks.', '2014-11-07 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281618, 1134207, 47974, '<td valign="top">While I understand the emotion and reason for the photograph it just looks like a snapshot of three guys.  It is also a little soft which makes it not have any pop and the girl on the left is distracting.</td>', 'While I understand the emotion and reason for the photograph it just looks like a snapshot of three guys.  It is also a little soft which makes it not have any pop and the girl on the left is distracting.', '2014-11-07 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281620, 1134845, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and powerfully emotional shot........great job...........may have been stronger from a bit lower perspective.</td>', 'Wonderful and powerfully emotional shot........great job...........may have been stronger from a bit lower perspective.', '2014-11-07 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281622, 1133364, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  As a photograph it is terrible........as an artistic piece it is brilliant.  For now it is a 7, may go up on my 2nd pass thru. I bet this would look amazing printed large on metal.</td>', 'Interesting capture.  As a photograph it is terrible........as an artistic piece it is brilliant.  For now it is a 7, may go up on my 2nd pass thru. I bet this would look amazing printed large on metal.', '2014-11-07 11:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281623, 1133158, 118154, '<td valign="top">My socks are well and truly blown off .</td>', 'My socks are well and truly blown off .', '2014-11-07 11:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281624, 1133706, 47974, '<td valign="top">interesting portrait, wish you had left off the border (don''t think it adds anything to the photo).</td>', 'interesting portrait, wish you had left off the border (don''t think it adds anything to the photo).', '2014-11-07 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281625, 1133658, 118154, '<td valign="top">Hard to resist but I am being harsh .6.</td>', 'Hard to resist but I am being harsh .6.', '2014-11-07 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281626, 1134424, 47974, '<td valign="top">A photograph of a photographer taking a photograph is just not that interesting, especially when its out of focus and has blown highlights.  Not that you could have done anything about against his flash.</td>', 'A photograph of a photographer taking a photograph is just not that interesting, especially when its out of focus and has blown highlights.  Not that you could have done anything about against his flash.', '2014-11-07 11:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281628, 1133924, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a hectic scene.  Really love how this came out.  Still trying to work out how you got him in such sharp focus but the blurriness of people in the background.</td>', 'Great capture of a hectic scene.  Really love how this came out.  Still trying to work out how you got him in such sharp focus but the blurriness of people in the background.', '2014-11-07 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281630, 1134767, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, wish the bird was a bit sharper (I know it is hard because you had to use a slow shutter speed and these guys strike really really fast).</td>', 'Beautiful colors, wish the bird was a bit sharper (I know it is hard because you had to use a slow shutter speed and these guys strike really really fast).', '2014-11-07 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
