(7282340, 1133302, 159723, '<td valign="top">Gave you 8 before, back to comment. I didn''t let this effect my voting, but is there a scratch and a grain of dirt on your lense? Still lovely light, nice DOF and cute couple. They look very much in love, and you captured the emotion perfectly.  If I were to comment on one thing, and it''s probably very silly, it would be that I wish the young man was not wearing that shirt. A non-striped shirt might have suited the country surroundings better, but it was perhaps not up to you :) Anyway, well done!</td>', 'Gave you 8 before, back to comment. I didn''t let this effect my voting, but is there a scratch and a grain of dirt on your lense? Still lovely light, nice DOF and cute couple. They look very much in love, and you captured the emotion perfectly.  If I were to comment on one thing, and it''s probably very silly, it would be that I wish the young man was not wearing that shirt. A non-striped shirt might have suited the country surroundings better, but it was perhaps not up to you :) Anyway, well done!', '2014-11-08 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
