(7282592, 1134728, 159723, '<td valign="top">Commenting only on this one. Being a newbie I find images like this one really hard to score. I have no knowledge of how they are made and the amount of work it takes to capture and create them. I would love to know more about the process so I can score them in the future. So, my feedback is unfortunately limited to saying that I think the flow of the colours, from the orange to the purple, looks really good :)</td>', 'Commenting only on this one. Being a newbie I find images like this one really hard to score. I have no knowledge of how they are made and the amount of work it takes to capture and create them. I would love to know more about the process so I can score them in the future. So, my feedback is unfortunately limited to saying that I think the flow of the colours, from the orange to the purple, looks really good :)', '2014-11-09 07:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
