(7282678, 1134422, 30364, '<td valign="top">Intriguing photograph.  I thought I''d tried every bit of camera negligence and abuse there is, but I never did this.  Possibly you used a tripod but kicked the Earth sideways.  That would be a good trick, and this is a strangely interesting image.  Thank you.</td>', 'Intriguing photograph.  I thought I''d tried every bit of camera negligence and abuse there is, but I never did this.  Possibly you used a tripod but kicked the Earth sideways.  That would be a good trick, and this is a strangely interesting image.  Thank you.', '2014-11-09 10:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
