(7282775, 1133164, 101668, '<td valign="top">Now how wonderful is this? There is just something in hard work, it always makes a great picture. And they have done their bit in life, it''s etched onto their faces.</td>', 'Now how wonderful is this? There is just something in hard work, it always makes a great picture. And they have done their bit in life, it''s etched onto their faces.', '2014-11-09 12:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
