(7283123, 1133171, 25024, '<td valign="top">What an excellent action shot! I love the wing shape and the direction of his head. Lovely blur in the wingtips and perfect DOF, great composition, great score!</td>', 'What an excellent action shot! I love the wing shape and the direction of his head. Lovely blur in the wingtips and perfect DOF, great composition, great score!', '2014-11-10 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
