(7283131, 1133184, 25024, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint to isolate her against the sky, though I find the right hand structure distracting it doesn''t feel as though its adding anything to the overall image. Just a personal thing, I''m not keen on selective desat unless its done very subtly. Good luck, I hope you do well with it.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint to isolate her against the sky, though I find the right hand structure distracting it doesn''t feel as though its adding anything to the overall image. Just a personal thing, I''m not keen on selective desat unless its done very subtly. Good luck, I hope you do well with it.', '2014-11-10 09:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283132, 1133675, 150277, '<td valign="top">The light green on red is nice, although I might have enjoyed the image more had the plants been even more out of focus.  As they are, they seem to compete a bit with the apple for attention.  I also thought the fingers being visible were a bit distracting and did not add anything to the image.</td>', 'The light green on red is nice, although I might have enjoyed the image more had the plants been even more out of focus.  As they are, they seem to compete a bit with the apple for attention.  I also thought the fingers being visible were a bit distracting and did not add anything to the image.', '2014-11-10 09:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283133, 1133250, 150277, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  This seems like an image that wouldn''t be real, like it is set on the moon or mars.  But then it is a photo so I think you did a great job.</td>', 'Interesting.  This seems like an image that wouldn''t be real, like it is set on the moon or mars.  But then it is a photo so I think you did a great job.', '2014-11-10 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
