(7283912, 1134517, 101668, '<td valign="top">I am trying to comment on every entry and as the picture downloads I start writing my first impressions. The first word that came to mind is "Wow". Can say no more!</td>', 'I am trying to comment on every entry and as the picture downloads I start writing my first impressions. The first word that came to mind is "Wow". Can say no more!', '2014-11-11 09:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283913, 1133302, 25024, '<td valign="top">A tender moment well captured though perhaps a little too centred. I can''t help thinking that there was a great opportunity here for a closer head and shoulders against the backlight with her lovely hair filling the background between them - delicious! Good luck</td>', 'A tender moment well captured though perhaps a little too centred. I can''t help thinking that there was a great opportunity here for a closer head and shoulders against the backlight with her lovely hair filling the background between them - delicious! Good luck', '2014-11-11 09:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
