(7283915, 1134722, 25024, '<td valign="top">I can see why you''ve opted for this composition but that bridge looks and feels horrible and so out of place with the location, sorry. Good luck</td>', 'I can see why you''ve opted for this composition but that bridge looks and feels horrible and so out of place with the location, sorry. Good luck', '2014-11-11 09:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
