(7284011, 1134614, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great look of concentration, great composition, great DOF, great image, I''m not sure if you''ve used selective desat here but I do like the subdued tones. Should do well</td>', 'Great look of concentration, great composition, great DOF, great image, I''m not sure if you''ve used selective desat here but I do like the subdued tones. Should do well', '2014-11-11 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
