(7284017, 1134666, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good timing, a good action shot though perhaps too fast a shutter speed for my taste and too central but still a goos shot, well done</td>', 'Good timing, a good action shot though perhaps too fast a shutter speed for my taste and too central but still a goos shot, well done', '2014-11-11 11:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
