(7284460, 1134614, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this more the more I look at it. Photography is this. <br/> <br/>Did you capture a moment? a feeling? You captured the tension of the muscles, the momentary confidence of the eyes. We are sure the arrow will hit its mark.<br/> <br/>I look at this photo and think no, it''s not a moment, it''s something more than that. Perhaps you''ve removed time completely. and you captured forever.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077284" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love this more the more I look at it. Photography is this.  Did you capture a moment? a feeling? You captured the tension of the muscles, the momentary confidence of the eyes. We are sure the arrow will hit its mark. I look at this photo and think no, it''s not a moment, it''s something more than that. Perhaps you''ve removed time completely. and you captured forever. Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2014-11-11 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
