(7284537, 1133158, 37858, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ShutterRev:</b></div><hr/><i> This will probably be an extremely stunning print on a Metallic Pearl paper. It''s almost in the over-processed category, but not quite, hopefully it would print well in large format. The heavy saturation works here, love the definition in the clouds. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>As it happens I had this printed on canvas last week at 24 in. X 16 in.  I was very pleased with the way it turned out. After it is framed, it will hang in my home.  The foreground, which I agree looks a bit odd or "messy" onscreen, ends up looking rather "painterly" on canvas at the larger size.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-11-12 00:31:16.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by ShutterRev: This will probably be an extremely stunning print on a Metallic Pearl paper. It''s almost in the over-processed category, but not quite, hopefully it would print well in large format. The heavy saturation works here, love the definition in the clouds.   As it happens I had this printed on canvas last week at 24 in. X 16 in.  I was very pleased with the way it turned out. After it is framed, it will hang in my home.  The foreground, which I agree looks a bit odd or "messy" onscreen, ends up looking rather "painterly" on canvas at the larger size. Thanks for all the comments.', '2014-11-12 00:28:57.000000', '2014-11-12 00:31:16.000000', 0),
(7284538, 1134721, 114285, '<td valign="top">A powerful photo, that needed to be on the front page. I ended up giving three 10''s, this was well deserved!</td>', 'A powerful photo, that needed to be on the front page. I ended up giving three 10''s, this was well deserved!', '2014-11-12 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284540, 1134424, 114285, '<td valign="top"><i><b> <br/>I love this shot. A handful of folks may like it almost as much as I do. The general public? Probably not so much. In my entire 12 year archive, I''ve got nothing that will impress any of you enough to score well, so I''m going with something I love instead.</b></i> <br/> <br/>And so should we all, WD on 2 blings, that''s a girl!!!</td>', ' I love this shot. A handful of folks may like it almost as much as I do. The general public? Probably not so much. In my entire 12 year archive, I''ve got nothing that will impress any of you enough to score well, so I''m going with something I love instead.  And so should we all, WD on 2 blings, that''s a girl!!!', '2014-11-12 00:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284543, 1134775, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great result Amanda. WD!</td>', 'Great result Amanda. WD!', '2014-11-12 00:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
