(7284548, 1134812, 176839, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes life, did you help him? 8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes all these lovely people of no fixed address,  I call my friends. I give them a hug every time I see them, have a meal with them, sit down on a busy street corner and chat  with them, give them the processed photos the next time I see them. Most if not all my friends are not looking for help, as we have a very good social service and health system here in Australia.  They just want to be acknowledged as equal human beings.  And God created all of us equal. ( some of us God favoured more, and gave us a natural tan) hehehe....... they just want respect, not for us to look the other way...... God bbless them all.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Yes life, did you help him? 8   Yes all these lovely people of no fixed address,  I call my friends. I give them a hug every time I see them, have a meal with them, sit down on a busy street corner and chat  with them, give them the processed photos the next time I see them. Most if not all my friends are not looking for help, as we have a very good social service and health system here in Australia.  They just want to be acknowledged as equal human beings.  And God created all of us equal. ( some of us God favoured more, and gave us a natural tan) hehehe....... they just want respect, not for us to look the other way...... God bbless them all.', '2014-11-12 00:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284549, 1134812, 176839, '<td valign="top">Ooops <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">neat</a>   just checked your profile....you are a fellow skip aswell....so you know what I ment about the  medical and  dole system here.<br/>I don''t know if you have people of no fixed address in Perth. But in NSW, VIC, SA   they are.</td>', 'Ooops  neat   just checked your profile....you are a fellow skip aswell....so you know what I ment about the  medical and  dole system here.I don''t know if you have people of no fixed address in Perth. But in NSW, VIC, SA   they are.', '2014-11-12 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284552, 1133823, 3214, '<td valign="top">Love the "story" and the expression in his eye, glad the voters liked it too!</td>', 'Love the "story" and the expression in his eye, glad the voters liked it too!', '2014-11-12 01:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284557, 1133757, 98565, '<td valign="top"><b>Woo-hoo once more! My first ribbon! <br/>I can''t believe it - thank you so much, dpc-voters!!!!</b> <br/> <br/>Since I reckoned without doing so well in this challenge I didn''t offer an explanation in photographer''s comments, which I really do regret now (and I don''t know if and how I can add a comment subsequently, sorry). But here it is:<br/> <br/>This image was taken August 2008, while a summer festival firework took place at the Olympic site in Munich/Germany. I knew about the firework and went up to the television tower observation deck next to the olympic stadion several hours before it was supposed to happen, positioned my camera on a tripod and waited for the sky rockets (@ melethia: no drone ;-) - can''t afford it!)<br/>Really happy that my plan worked out!<br/> <br/>What a perfekt start in my day (it''s about seven in the morning where I live)! I wish you also a great day!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-11-12 01:27:58.</i></td>', 'Woo-hoo once more! My first ribbon! I can''t believe it - thank you so much, dpc-voters!!!!  Since I reckoned without doing so well in this challenge I didn''t offer an explanation in photographer''s comments, which I really do regret now (and I don''t know if and how I can add a comment subsequently, sorry). But here it is: This image was taken August 2008, while a summer festival firework took place at the Olympic site in Munich/Germany. I knew about the firework and went up to the television tower observation deck next to the olympic stadion several hours before it was supposed to happen, positioned my camera on a tripod and waited for the sky rockets (@ melethia: no drone ;-) - can''t afford it!)Really happy that my plan worked out! What a perfekt start in my day (it''s about seven in the morning where I live)! I wish you also a great day!', '2014-11-12 01:26:03.000000', '2014-11-12 01:27:58.000000', 0),
(7284559, 1134697, 170018, '<td valign="top">Terrific!! Where is it?</td>', 'Terrific!! Where is it?', '2014-11-12 01:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
