(7284580, 1133524, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, I am really glad You like it!<br/> <br/>Photo was taken near Porvoo where one of the most famous Finnish painters, Albert Edelfelt, painted part of his paintings... nothing like copying the masters :)<br/> <br/>I think the nice summer clouds together with the greenish of the water (coming from algae) make the picture.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, I am really glad You like it! Photo was taken near Porvoo where one of the most famous Finnish painters, Albert Edelfelt, painted part of his paintings... nothing like copying the masters :) I think the nice summer clouds together with the greenish of the water (coming from algae) make the picture.', '2014-11-12 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284582, 1134648, 50641, '<td valign="top">You are brave to have included the fence.</td>', 'You are brave to have included the fence.', '2014-11-12 02:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284584, 1134941, 30364, '<td valign="top">I forgot to mention that the picture would be diminished, less interesting, without the gap in the left half ... presumably a breakwater entrance.  But it''s there, so it isn''t.</td>', 'I forgot to mention that the picture would be diminished, less interesting, without the gap in the left half ... presumably a breakwater entrance.  But it''s there, so it isn''t.', '2014-11-12 03:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
