(7284619, 1134775, 124982, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Ammie! So glad to see you do so well ++</td>', 'Congrats, Ammie! So glad to see you do so well ++', '2014-11-12 06:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7284621, 1133817, 70128, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments. Very instructive! I took this picture in 2006, and yes, the idea was to actually have the branches and leaves in front, which gave the picture a nice coloring and an interesting feeling. I took another one from a different angle and it was too green and flat. I agree that some soft focus on the branches might give this a nicer perspective, but there''s very little you can do with a basic compact camera. Same with the overexposed bits. <br/>I admit I''m a little disappointed at the grading. It''s not my best picture and I wasn''t expecting this to be my personal best or anything, but a 4.84 seems to be a bit too low, IMO.<br/>Thank you all again!</td>', 'Thank you for the comments. Very instructive! I took this picture in 2006, and yes, the idea was to actually have the branches and leaves in front, which gave the picture a nice coloring and an interesting feeling. I took another one from a different angle and it was too green and flat. I agree that some soft focus on the branches might give this a nicer perspective, but there''s very little you can do with a basic compact camera. Same with the overexposed bits. I admit I''m a little disappointed at the grading. It''s not my best picture and I wasn''t expecting this to be my personal best or anything, but a 4.84 seems to be a bit too low, IMO.Thank you all again!', '2014-11-12 07:22:53.000000', NULL, 0),
