(7285482, 1134614, 81042, '<td valign="top">Thanks friends for the many comments. Sadly, when I submitted the image I was in a rush and didn''t double check for the original. Classic rookie mistake. :( <br/> <br/>I have been carefully saving raw back ups for 7 years and wouldn''t you know it I am missing 7 months in 2010 when this picture was taken.  <br/> <br/>I apologize to all for my oversight.<br/><b> <br/>The picture is of a young boy from the Hadzabe tribe in Northern Tanzania. They are a khoisan people group who are amazing hunters. It is always amazing to travel to a place where people live completely disengaged from the world and the conveniences of life in 2014 and yet are full of life and joy. Africa is an amazing place and I am privileged to live here...</b></td>', 'Thanks friends for the many comments. Sadly, when I submitted the image I was in a rush and didn''t double check for the original. Classic rookie mistake. :(  I have been carefully saving raw back ups for 7 years and wouldn''t you know it I am missing 7 months in 2010 when this picture was taken.   I apologize to all for my oversight. The picture is of a young boy from the Hadzabe tribe in Northern Tanzania. They are a khoisan people group who are amazing hunters. It is always amazing to travel to a place where people live completely disengaged from the world and the conveniences of life in 2014 and yet are full of life and joy. Africa is an amazing place and I am privileged to live here...', '2014-11-15 13:25:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7285496, 1134614, 19825, '<td valign="top">Sorry to hear of the DQ. Magnificent image.</td>', 'Sorry to hear of the DQ. Magnificent image.', '2014-11-15 16:11:53.000000', NULL, 0),
