(7287448, 1134910, 68504, '<td valign="top">but, but the dog and the boy ARE focused. perfectly. our not dissimilar dog used to bounce balloons off her nose, sometimes even say awhoo. awhoo.</td>', 'but, but the dog and the boy ARE focused. perfectly. our not dissimilar dog used to bounce balloons off her nose, sometimes even say awhoo. awhoo.', '2014-11-24 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 0),
